The '''sublevel containment chamber'''<ref name="Identity" /> was an underground containment facility in [[Tantiss Base]]<ref name="Metamorphosis" /> on the [[planet]]<ref name="TFABG">[[Star Wars: The Force Awakens Beginner Game|''Star Wars: The Force Awakens'' Beginner Game]]</ref> [[Wayland]]. It was used to hold [[cloning|cloned]] [[Zillo Beast]]s&mdash;referred to by [[Royce Hemlock]] as "the assets"&mdash;created by the [[Advanced Science Division]].<ref name="Metamorphosis" /> The beasts were kept in<ref name="Flash">{{TBB|Flash Strike}}</ref> large circular [[Zillo tank]]s<ref name="EG">{{SW|url=series/the-bad-batch/flash-strike-episode-guide|text="Flash Strike" Episode Guide &#124; Star Wars: The Bad Batch}}</ref> filled with liquid and lit up by multiple [[floodlight]]s while the area was patrolled by [[clone commando]]s and [[TK stormtrooper]]s. A [[NNJ-40 "Thunderbolt" long-range ion cannon]] emplacement was mounted in an elevated position above the tank and used to sedate the beasts when they became aggressive.<ref name="Flash" />

